description=Mesa freedreno Vulkan for Adreno (a6xx/a7xx/a8xx, KGSL). Vulkan 1.4, android-strict=true (Mesa default, required: false breaks UE4 games with pc=0). No permissions xml override. Original driver preserved at /vendor/lib64/hw/vulkan.adreno.so. Uninstall restores ro.hardware.vulkan automatically.